  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1485552639285629}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 448
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 我当初在逸风城擂台取胜从而成为宁王府供奉，之后又在误打误撞之下获知宁王勾结魔修将供奉炼为丹药以延寿增修的真相，险些遭天魔道长老灭口。当时还是前辈从魔修手里救下我。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114563936933968143}
